#: ui/GlobalConfig.qml:59
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Battery Levels"
msgstr "Razine baterije"

#: ui/GlobalConfig.qml:67
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"@label:spinbox Low battery level percentage for the main power supply battery"
msgid "&Low level:"
msgstr "&Niska razina:"

#: ui/GlobalConfig.qml:75
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@accessible:name:spinbox"
msgid "Low battery level"
msgstr "Niska razina baterije"

#: ui/GlobalConfig.qml:100
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"The battery charge will be considered low when it drops to this level. "
"Settings for low battery will be used instead of regular battery settings."
msgstr ""
"Napunjenost baterije smatrat će se niskom kada padne na ovu razinu. "
"Postavke za nisku razinu baterije koristit će se umjesto uobičajenih postavki."

#: ui/GlobalConfig.qml:107
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"@label:spinbox Critical battery level percentage for the main power supply "
"battery"
msgid "Cr&itical level:"
msgstr "Kri&tična razina:"

#: ui/GlobalConfig.qml:115
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@accessible:name:spinbox"
msgid "Critical battery level"
msgstr "Kritična razina baterije"

#: ui/GlobalConfig.qml:140
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"The battery charge will be considered critical when it drops to this level. "
"After a brief warning, the system will automatically suspend or shut down, "
"according to the configured critical battery level action."
msgstr ""
"Napunjenost baterije smatrat će se kritičnom kada padne na ovu razinu. "
"Nakon kratkog upozorenja, sustav će se automatski obustaviti ili isključiti, "
"ovisno o podešenoj radnji za kritičnu razinu baterije."

#: ui/GlobalConfig.qml:149
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:status"
msgid ""
"The action you had previously configured for reaching the critical battery "
"level is now unsupported on your system. Please select a different one."
msgstr ""
"Radnja koju ste prethodno podesili za postizanje kritične razine baterije više "
"nije podržana na vašem sustavu. Odaberite drugu radnju."

#: ui/GlobalConfig.qml:156
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"@label:combobox Power action such as sleep/hibernate that will be executed "
"when the critical battery level is reached"
msgid "A&t critical level:"
msgstr "N&a kritičnoj razini:"

#: ui/GlobalConfig.qml:158
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@accessible:name:combobox"
msgid "Action performed at critical battery level"
msgstr "Radnja koja se izvodi na kritičnoj razini baterije"

#: ui/GlobalConfig.qml:183
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:spinbox Low battery level percentage for peripheral devices"
msgid "Low level for peripheral d&evices:"
msgstr "Niska razina za vanjs&ke uređaje:"

#: ui/GlobalConfig.qml:191
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@accessible:name:spinbox"
msgid "Low battery level for peripheral devices"
msgstr "Niska razina baterije za vanjske uređaje"

#: ui/GlobalConfig.qml:216
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"The battery charge for peripheral devices will be considered low when it "
"reaches this level."
msgstr ""
"Napunjenost baterije vanjskih uređaja smatrat će se niskom kada padne na ovu razinu."

#: ui/GlobalConfig.qml:224
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Charge Limit"
msgstr "Ograničenje punjenja"

#: ui/GlobalConfig.qml:235
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:checkbox"
msgid "&Battery protection:"
msgstr "&Zaštita baterije:"

#: ui/GlobalConfig.qml:236
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@text:checkbox"
msgid "Limit the maximum battery charge"
msgstr "Ograniči maksimalnu napunjenost baterije"

#: ui/GlobalConfig.qml:244
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"@label:spinbox Battery will stop charging when this charge percentage is "
"reached"
msgid "&Stop charging at:"
msgstr "Z&austavi punjenje na:"

#: ui/GlobalConfig.qml:295
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"@label:spinbox Battery will start charging again when this charge percentage "
"is reached, after having hit the stop-charging threshold earlier"
msgid "Start charging once &below:"
msgstr "Započni punjenje kada je i&spod:"

#: ui/GlobalConfig.qml:373
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:status"
msgid ""
"You might have to disconnect and re-connect the power source to start "
"charging the battery again."
msgstr ""
"Možda ćete morati odspojiti i ponovno spojiti izvor napajanja kako bi punjenje baterije započelo."

#: ui/GlobalConfig.qml:384
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Regularly charging the battery close to 100%, or fully discharging it, may "
"accelerate deterioration of battery health. By limiting the maximum battery "
"charge, you can help extend the battery lifespan."
msgstr ""
"Redovito punjenje baterije blizu 100% ili njezino potpuno pražnjenje može ubrzati "
"narušavanje zdravlja baterije. Ograničavanjem maksimalne napunjenosti baterije možete "
"pomoći u produljenju njezina vijeka trajanja."

